    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/29/emo_laugh-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "なるほど。道中で偶然会ったんですね。相変わらず、パ……転校生の先輩は、磁石みたいに知り合いを引きつけちゃう性質がありますね？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies2_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "どうしてわたしがひとりで『血の池地獄』を眺めてるのか、ですか？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "じつは、パパとママがわたしの喜ぶお土産をそれぞれ選んでるみたいで、わたしは外で買い物が終わるのを待ってるんですよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies2_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/29/emo_amazed-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "その場にいたら、何度『ほしいもの』を質問されるかわからないですからね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "せっかくですから、写真でもどうですか？　『血の池地獄』とか撮ったら、黒森先輩が喜びそうです。あのひと中二病ですし、非日常的な風景とかに目がないんですよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "winter-civvies2_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "trick",
    "position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "『ククク……よくやった、シズ！　ボクたち翼の折れた堕天使（ルシフェル）たちは楽園から追放され地上へと向かったが、地獄には縁がなかったからな』"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "『一度、サタンとの邂逅を果たしたいと思っていたんだ！』"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "winter-civvies2_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 476
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しずく",
    "text": "みたいな、テンション高いメールが来る光景が容易に想像できます"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 29,
    "dress": "winter-civvies2",
